OL,3,GNEWSAPolice divers search lake for Noah
OL,4,AWoods, 3, as hundreds of volunteers
OL,5,Ascour local area
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice divers have entered a lake in
OL,8,Fsearch for three-year-old Noah Woods,
OL,9,Fwho went missing from a playground in
OL,10,FBrantham, Suffolk on Tuesday afternoon
OL,12,FHundreds of volunteers are taking part
OL,13,Fin the search efforts, but police have
OL,14,Fwarned them to avoid open water and
OL,15,Frailways, and not to use drones
OL,17,FCCTV footage shows the toddler playing
OL,18,Fbefore he disappeared - here's what we
OL,19,Fknow so far
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
