OL,3,GNEWSAPolice divers search lake for Noah
OL,4,AWoods, 3, as hundreds of volunteers
OL,5,Ascour local area
OL,6,
OL,7,FSuffolk Police say there is "nothing to
OL,8,Findicate anything sinister or any
OL,9,Felement of criminality has taken place,
OL,10,Falthough we keep an open mind as to the
OL,11,Fcircumstances"
OL,13,FNoah, who is partially deaf and
OL,14,Fnon-verbal, was with a relative before
OL,15,Fhe went missing. He is unlikely to
OL,16,Frespond to his name being called,
OL,17,Fpolice say
OL,19,FResidents are being asked to check CCTV
OL,20,For doorbell cameras for any sightings
OL,21,Fof the boy, as well as sheds and
OL,22,Foutbuildings
